  _pages:
  - Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 22c07d43740440cd9f088570b404ce38, type: 3}
    Video: {fileID: 0}
    Title: Skill Points (SP)
    Body: "The SP bar at the top left stores your power.\nShoot before it's full and your gun fires a weak normal shot.\nWhen it's full, your next shot becomes a powerful cursed shot."
  - Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: deddc573c6194b2895a8975190c0d73a, type: 3}
    Video: {fileID: 0}
    Title: Gaining SP
    Body: "Fight to build SP:\n- Melee attacks: gain SP slowly.\n- Parry: press {F} right before a hit lands to gain SP fast.\n- Glory Kill: when an enemy is open, press {E} for a huge SP boost."
  - Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2534ee2a789743749d0fa6c328d9c885, type: 3}
    Video: {fileID: 0}
    Title: Losing SP
    Body: "Unused SP starts draining after 10 seconds (1 SP per second).\nEvery shot uses all of your SP, normal or cursed.\nWant a cursed shot? Don't fire until the bar is full."
